Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 20:12:01 +0200
Subject: Backport PNC alignment fixes from 4.19 to 4.22

- Use camel-community-version for camel-test-infra-* test deps (14 starters)
  PME aligns camel-version property globally, which breaks test-infra
  resolution since those artifacts are not built in PNC
- Add openshift-maven-plugin to pluginManagement for PME alignment
- Add guava exclusions (error_prone_annotations, checker-qual) to
  camel-google-bigquery-starter

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
